"&amp;rarr; Extensions &amp;rarr; DEV Community API Keys."
msgstr ""
"DEV.to 使用个人 API 密钥进行认证。请在 设置 &rarr; 扩展 &rarr; DEV Community API Keys 下生成。"

msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

msgid "your DEV.to API key"
msgstr "你的 DEV.to API 密钥"

msgid "Create one at DEV.to → Settings → Extensions → DEV Community API Keys."
msgstr "在 DEV.to 的「设置 → 扩展 → DEV Community API Keys」中创建。"

msgid ""
"Posts publish as DEV.to articles (title + Markdown body). The API key can be"
" revoked at any time from your DEV.to settings."
msgstr "内容会以 DEV.to 文章形式发布（标题 + Markdown 正文）。API 密钥可随时在 DEV.to 设置中撤销。"

msgid "Manage connected social media accounts for this workspace."
msgstr "管理当前工作区已连接的社交媒体账号。"

msgid "Connect Account"
msgstr "连接账号"

msgid "No accounts connected yet"
msgstr "还没有连接账号"

msgid ""
"Connect your social media accounts to start publishing content, tracking "
"engagement, and managing your inbox."
msgstr "连接你的社交媒体账号，即可开始发布内容、跟踪互动并管理收件箱。"

msgid "Connect Your First Account"
msgstr "连接你的第一个账号"

msgid ""
"Mastodon is federated, enter your profile URL to begin the connection "
"process."
msgstr "Mastodon 是联邦网络，输入你的主页地址开始连接。"

msgid "Profile URL"
msgstr "个人主页地址"

msgid "mastodon.social@yourusername"
msgstr "mastodon.social@yourusername"

msgid "The Mastodon instance where your account lives"
msgstr "你的账号所在的 Mastodon 实例"

msgid ""
"After entering your instance URL, you'll be redirected to your Mastodon "
"instance to authorize access. We request"
msgstr "填写实例地址后，会跳转到你的 Mastodon 实例进行授权。我们只申请"

msgid "permissions."
msgstr "权限。"

msgid "Continue to Mastodon"
msgstr "继续前往 Mastodon"

msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "断开连接"

msgid "This revokes BrightBean's access to the account."
msgstr "此操作将撤销 BrightBean 对该账号的访问权限。"

msgid ""
"YouTube data, analytics and copied comments are deleted immediately, "
"including notification copies. Your original uploads and posts shared with "
"other channels stay."
msgstr "YouTube 数据、分析数据和已复制的评论会被立即删除（含通知副本）。你原始的上传内容以及与其他渠道共享的帖子会保留。"

msgid ""
"Its analytics, inbox messages and posts made only for it are deleted from "
"BrightBean. Posts shared with other channels stay."
msgstr "该渠道的分析数据、收件箱消息和仅为其创建的内容将从 BrightBean 中删除，与其他渠道共享的帖子会保留。"

msgid "Some features are unavailable."
msgstr "部分功能不可用。"

msgid ""
"Instagram DM access is unavailable for this connection. Contact your "
"administrator to enable it."
msgstr "该连接无法使用 Instagram 私信。请联系管理员开启。"

msgid ""
"DMs unavailable: grant messaging access on the linked Facebook Page, then "
"reconnect this account."
msgstr "私信不可用：请在关联的 Facebook 主页上授予消息权限，然后重新连接该账号。"

msgid "Some real-time inbox updates are unavailable."
msgstr "部分收件箱实时更新不可用。"

msgid ""
"Set recurring time slots for when queued posts are automatically published."
msgstr "设置循环时段，用于队列中的内容自动发布。"

msgid "Click to edit"
msgstr "点击编辑"

msgid "Remove slot"
msgstr "移除时段"

msgid "Add time slot"
msgstr "添加时段"

msgid "Token Expiring"
msgstr "令牌即将过期"

msgid "Disconnected"
msgstr "已断开"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "错误"

msgid ""
"Control whether posts need to be reviewed before they can be scheduled or "
"published."
msgstr "控制内容在排期或发布前是否需要审批。"

msgid "Anyone with publishing rights can schedule or publish directly."
msgstr "任何拥有发布权限的人都可以直接排期或发布。"

msgid ""
"Creators can choose to submit a post for review, but it's not required."
msgstr "创作者可以自行选择是否提交内容送审，不是必须的。"

msgid ""
"Every post must be approved by a team member with review rights before it "
"can go out."
msgstr "每条内容都必须由拥有审阅权的团队成员批准后才能发布。"

msgid ""
"Posts go through internal review, then are sent to the client portal for "
"final sign-off."
msgstr "内容先经过内部审阅，再发送到客户门户做最终确认。"

msgid ""
"Reviewers are workspace members with the \"Approve posts\" permission. "
"Manage them on the"
msgstr "审阅者是拥有「审批内容」权限的工作区成员。请在以下位置管理："

msgid "Members"
msgstr "成员"

msgid "page."
msgstr "页面。"

msgid "No workspaces yet. Create your first workspace to get started."
msgstr "还没有工作区。创建第一个工作区即可开始。"

msgid "New workspace"
msgstr "新建工作区"

msgid "Workspace Name"
msgstr "工作区名称"

msgid "Remove logo"
msgstr "移除标识"

msgid "Logo"
msgstr "标识"

msgid "JPEG, PNG, WebP, or GIF. Max 2 MB."
msgstr "JPEG、PNG、WebP 或 GIF，最大 2 MB。"

msgid "Upload Logo"
msgstr "上传标识"

msgid ""
"This workspace is currently archived. Restoring it will make it visible in "
"the sidebar and accessible to all members again."
msgstr "此工作区当前已归档。恢复后它将重新显示在侧边栏，所有成员可以再次访问。"

msgid ""
"Archiving hides this workspace from the sidebar and prevents new posts. All "
"existing data is preserved and the workspace can be restored at any time."
msgstr "归档会把此工作区从侧边栏隐藏，并阻止新内容发布。已有数据全部保留，随时可以恢复。"

#| msgid "Cannot archive the last workspace in the organization."
msgid ""
"You cannot archive the last active workspace in the organization. Create "
"another workspace first."
msgstr "无法归档组织里最后一个活跃工作区，请先创建另一个工作区。"

msgid "Restore Workspace"
msgstr "恢复工作区"

msgid "Archive Workspace"
msgstr "归档工作区"

msgid "Archive this workspace"
msgstr "归档此工作区"

msgid "Are you sure you want to archive"
msgstr "确定要归档"

msgid "Yes, archive this workspace"
msgstr "确认归档此工作区"

msgid "Delete this workspace"
msgstr "删除此工作区"

msgid ""
"Permanently delete this workspace and all of its data. This includes all "
"posts, connected social accounts, media assets, and workspace memberships. "
"This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "永久删除此工作区及其所有数据，包括所有内容、已连接的社交账号、媒体素材和工作区成员关系。此操作无法撤销。"

#| msgid "Cannot delete the last workspace in the organization."
msgid ""
"You cannot delete the last active workspace in the organization. Create "
"another workspace first."
msgstr "无法删除组织里最后一个活跃工作区，请先创建另一个工作区。"

msgid "Delete Workspace"
msgstr "删除工作区"

msgid "Are you sure you want to permanently delete"
msgstr "确定要永久删除"

msgid "? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "？此操作不可撤销。"

msgid "Connected social accounts"
msgstr "已连接的社交账号"

msgid "Workspace memberships"
msgstr "工作区成员关系"

msgid "Yes, delete this workspace"
msgstr "确认删除此工作区"
